# Event$ Counter | ValidSA$ Spell | ValidCause$ SpellAbility.YouCtrl |
# ReplaceWith$ DBRemove: ai's Counterspell would counter human's Grizzly Bears,
# but ai controls Guile, so the counter is replaced: the Bears are exiled
# instead and ai, confirming Play's "may", plays the card from exile without
# paying its mana cost. It resolves under ai's control.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 8 U
tapformana ai 9 U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 10
queue confirmeffect true
resolvestack
